        },
        {
          "page": "2",
          "section": "II.A Material",
          "quote": "The effect of super-solidus heat treatments has been investigated on the SX Ni-base superalloy of the third-generation CMSX-10 K casted by Howmet Alcoa, which contains a high level of refractory elements (W, Re, Mo and Ta), ~ 19 wt pct. The chemical composition of the used SX material is listed in Table I.",
          "table": null,
          "figure": null,
          "chunk_id": "9490feae8bf67ac8:part:001"
        }
      ]
